WEBVTT

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.760
It's nothing new.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.610
She'll wake up soon.

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:17.250
Gripen...

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.740
Hooray! It's Daddy!

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.680
Hugs!

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.960
I was told you'd be arriving tomorrow.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.380
I came early so I could see you, Daddy!

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.770
Then call first.

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:34.730
Come on, say hello to everyone else.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.530
It's been so long since we 
saw each other, though!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:45.840
I'm F-15J-ANM Eagle, 
deployed from Naha Base!

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.510
I spent almost every day shooting 
down Xi over the East China Sea!

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:52.430
Great to meet you all!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.830
<b>Refugees' Fate Remains Uncertain</b>

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:30.110
<i>Yashirodoori-san said he'd talk to his bosses
 and see if Gripen could be tested again.</i>

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:34.090
<i>That was three days ago.</i>

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.590
<b>Refugees' Fate Remains Uncertain

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.100
Come in.

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.460
Kei, you got work today?

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.510
Nope.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.120
Come with me, then!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.020
Come on!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.940
Here you go.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:53.400
<i>The World You See</i>

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.280
You're paying for this, okay, Kei?

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.400
Let's eat!

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.560
You dragged me here,
<i>and</i> you want me to pay, too?

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.570
Yeah, that's the spirit!

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:03.690
It's better when you're full 
of energy, even if you're mad.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:09.260
Something's been bugging you ever 
since you got that job, right?

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.390
Won't you tell me what it is?

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.210
Sorry, let me hide!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.240
Where'd she go?

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:24.960
Are they gone? They're gone, right?

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.190
Great!

00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:28.370
I-Is that you, Eagle?

00:03:31.430 --> 00:03:34.210
You're the person who was with Daddy!

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.490
And who are <i>you</i>?

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.880
Sh-She's a co-worker. She just started!

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.930
This is only the second
time we've met, actually.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.640
You seem <i>awfully</i> close, though.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.950
I-I think it's because she 
spent time in America?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.600
Hey, what the hell happened?

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:55.580
I finally get permission to leave,
 and they keep saying,

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.240
"You can't do this! You can't do that!"

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.960
And <i>how long</i> are you going 
to keep holding on to him?

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:03.750
Oh, I know!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.050
I don't know this area well.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.650
Show me around!

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.280
What is your problem?

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.770
Kei is with me right now!

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:16.310
You can't just interrupt us 
and try to drag him off!

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:20.190
Then let's all go together!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.690
Sorry.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.780
Go buy something for her.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.480
Why do I have to do that?

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.830
I want a shake!

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.450
A strawberry shake!

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.790
You can tell, right?

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.610
Shake! Shake! Strawberry shake!

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.390
She's basically a kid.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.170
I'll tell her to go back to the base, okay?

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:35.210
Yummy and cute and pink!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.540
You owe me <i>big</i> for this.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.000
Okay! Okay! Okay!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:45.580
Hey, what's it like at the base?

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:49.770
They're making me do combat training,
but it's way too easy.

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:54.710
In the simulator, I can shoot down a unit
 of Xi fighters in less than three minutes.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.030
Wow!

00:04:56.030 --> 00:05:00.790
Well, I'm going to be protecting the base 
on my own from now on, so it's nothing.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:01.650
On your own?

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:02.840
Where's Gripen?

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.300
At the base.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.620
But that ends today.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:12.460
They decided to shut down her project,
 so tonight she'll be sent to the factory.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:14.850
No!

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.510
Hey... Kei!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.880
<i>Damn it! Damn it!</i>

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.030
<i>This is way too sudden!</i>

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.270
<i>What the hell was Yashirodoori doing?</i>

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:37.100
<i>Wasn't he going to figure out 
what was causing her problem?</i>

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:42.040
<i>But he can't even fend off his own bosses?</i>

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.510
Damn it all!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.870
<b>Komatsu Base</b>

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.590
I-I did it!

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:09.530
Where would she be?

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.140
Gripen.

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:22.150
Gripen, it's me.

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:25.470
Kei...

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.340
I'm sorry.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:32.110
I won't ask you to forgive me.

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:34.660
But I wanted to clear up 
the misunderstanding, at least.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.120
I don't hate you.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.650
I don't want you to go away.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:41.590
What I'm trying to say is...

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.120
You're you.

00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:44.760
You're not a Xi to me.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:47.440
Is that what you came to tell me?

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.250
Yeah.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:51.220
You went through all the trouble 
of asking Haruka to come here?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.850
I came on my own.

00:06:53.170 --> 00:06:54.930
I didn't get permission to enter the base.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.520
Strange.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.910
Why would you do that for 
something defective, like me?

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.490
You're not defective!

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:05.400
You're just not working right for now.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.970
With more time, you'll be able to fly.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:10.600
What evidence do you have?

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:13.080
None! I don't need it!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.410
That's crazy.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.850
But this is goodbye.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:26.170
I'm leaving at 6:00 PM to 
be scrapped at the factory.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.250
Are you okay with that?

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.560
It's because I'm useless. They can't help it.

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:34.010
Don't give up! You've worked so hard!

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:38.890
Or are you just done dealing 
with selfish humans?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.120
No!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.800
I still want to fly.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:49.170
I want to live in your world.

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:50.690
Let's run!

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.900
I'll take you out of the base.

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:56.290
We can hide somewhere until 
this all calms down.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:59.570
Don't worry. I'll go with you.

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:02.500
I won't leave you to fend for yourself.

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.040
Kei!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.030
What is that?

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:09.080
The Xi.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.710
<b>Haruka</b>

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.210
Yes.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.480
Yes. Yes. Roger.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.520
Hey!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.760
It was Haruka.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.520
He says he needs me.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:28.440
<i>That old fatass just told her 
the words she most wanted to hear!</i>

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.060
I'm going.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.220
I want to do what I can now.

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:34.170
Wait.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:36.710
I'll go with you.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:44.490
Enemy formation has reached 
the JMSDF's defensive line.

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:46.710
Oh, you're here.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.330
And you too, huh?

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.930
"You too"? Is that all you have to say?

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:57.350
You probably snuck in so you 
could take Gripen away, right?

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:59.140
It's nothing surprising.

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:03.090
Escort flotilla has launched 
their AA missiles!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:05.430
Ten seconds to impact!

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:06.490
Nine...

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:07.510
Eight...

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:08.450
Seven...

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:09.380
Six...

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.240
Five...

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:11.340
Four...

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:11.470
It's useless.

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.380
Three...

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:12.540
They'll miss.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.190
Two...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.330
One...

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.200
Zero!

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:17.670
Only one target kill!

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.920
The remaining units are unharmed 
and have passed the flotilla!

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:25.080
That's the main escort flotilla for the 
Sea of Japan, and that's all they can do, huh?

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:26.670
That's pretty depressing.

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:30.300
<i>Barbie 02, cleared for takeoff!</i>

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.300
Eagle?

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:38.510
I'm off to take care of this!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.680
<i>Don't worry about a thing!</i>

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.740
Is she okay?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:47.350
I'd like to say she is, but...

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:51.560
There are too many of them for a single 
Anima, plus our normal fighters,

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:53.520
to make a difference.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:54.600
Oh no...

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.780
We've sighted a formation behind them.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.800
A strike package consisting 
of primarily heavy bombers.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.380
There are at least twenty of them!

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.660
Twenty?!

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.080
They will encounter the 
forward JASDF units shortly.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.880
Arrow 01 to all units.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.910
The Xi are within our firing range.

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.950
We will launch a preemptive strike.

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.340
Wilco! Fox 1!

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:17.120
Fox 1!

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:23.140
Enemy EPCM is active.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.130
Fire two SRMs at each target.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.310
Fox 2!

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.470
Fox 2!

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:36.840
Break!

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:47.240
Fox 2!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:54.350
You won't get away!

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:58.010
Splash one and... two!

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.370
I'll protect everyone!

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.320
You understand the situation, right?

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.680
We want as many fighters in the 
air as possible right now.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.510
Defective or not, you're an Anima.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.760
You can do a lot more than a 
patrol craft or a trainer.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:15.950
But your schedule hasn't 
been adjusted at all.

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:20.670
Once you're up there,
 you're going to pass out and crash.

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.620
Crash... you mean die?

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.720
That's right.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.750
Is that your answer?

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:31.710
Didn't you tell me that 
moving on to the next choice

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.590
without figuring out the 
cause is what monkeys do?

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:38.920
But the minute the situation changes,
 you tell her to launch a suicide attack?

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.230
What happened to your pride as an engineer?

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:46.090
Of course, I've still got my pride.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.680
So I'm giving you another choice.

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.840
Run. The both of you.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:56.940
Get someplace safe and hide.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.630
We can keep Gripen safe,

00:11:58.630 --> 00:12:02.250
do everything we can to find the cause 
of the problem, and wait for our next chance.

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.810
And what happens to this town?

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.750
They'll probably burn it to the ground.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:08.740
Will people die?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.660
Sure. Lots of them.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:12.710
Go.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:13.960
There's no time.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:17.780
Five units have popped up from 
04010 relative to Komatsu!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.370
They're approaching the base?

00:12:19.370 --> 00:12:20.950
We can't counter them in time!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:28.250
Come on, just let me blow you up!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:33.520
Go away! Go away! Go away!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.810
What? <i>Again</i>?

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:41.420
<i>Barbie 02, change target.</i>

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:44.110
<i>A new enemy formation is 
attacking Komatsu Base!</i>

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.650
<i>Eliminate them immediately!</i>

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.660
It's not that easy!

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.760
<i>Barbie 02, you are to protect Komatsu Base!</i>

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:58.520
<i>I repeat! You are to protect Komatsu Base!</i>

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:59.640
I promised to protect everybody, but...

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.600
Sitrep!

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:07.900
We've been hit by the Xi.

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:11.350
They used NOE flight to slip 
past our radar network!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.450
The runway's taken damage!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:17.560
The enemy appears to have used special 
bombs to disable our runways!

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:22.610
If it was a direct hit, this shitty 
prefab would be gone in an instant.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:26.550
They missed. Get off the ground.

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:27.600
Go.

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:30.050
Take Gripen and...

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.800
I'm going to fly.

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:33.910
Gripen!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:39.310
Do you understand? If you go 
up there, you're going to die.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:41.590
I don't... want to die.

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:45.910
But the reason I exist 
is to protect humanity.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:50.210
And I have my memories of 
Kei in this city, too.

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:56.190
<i>She'll try to protect the city
 over something like that?</i>

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:58.960
<i>It was only a couple of weeks!</i>

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.080
<i>But she's...</i>

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.900
I'll fly with her.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:04.790
Kei!

00:14:04.790 --> 00:14:06.160
Don't be ridiculous.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:09.500
Do you really think a human can 
handle the way these girls fly?

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:13.380
As long as I'm near her, she can stay awake.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:14.310
So...

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:15.480
Kei!

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:19.700
I told you I wouldn't leave 
you to fend for yourself.

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:21.980
Okay.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:32.030
What is it with all you 
people having death wishes?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.500
But I like a good gamble.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:36.610
Hey, we're sending Gripen up.

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:39.140
But the runway's unusable.

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:44.380
Why don't we show them how 
it's done in the far north?

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.400
<i>Hokuriku Expressway</i>

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.170
Is this really okay?

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.720
She was built to be able to do this.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:15:00.970
She's light, so she can take off from 
highways or even normal streets.

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.550
Normal streets?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:08.650
Sweden, the country that built her, divides
 its fighters between multiple shelters.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.490
We've set the rear seat 
back to normal controls.

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:15.310
If you have to, 
you'll be able to control it.

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:20.820
And this g-suit will only reduce 
the forces by about 2Gs.

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:24.600
An Anima can easily exceed 10Gs in flight.

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.460
In the end, it's going to come down 
to your stamina and mental strength.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:30.720
Right.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.740
Hey, look!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.680
They've spotted us!

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:35.860
Get out of here!

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.620
Kei, ready?

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.460
Yeah.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.670
You have control.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.210
I have control.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:56.510
Barbie 01, cleared for take off!

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:08.240
H-Hey, don't tell me you're passing out.

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:11.140
There's static on the link...

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:14.290
I can't connect with the Daughter right.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:16.050
Is it because I'm aboard?

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:17.610
Is there anything you can do?

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:19.730
I'm dealing with it.

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:22.870
But I can't do it while I fight.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.310
At this rate...

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:27.250
I have control!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.330
Kei!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.300
You focus on that!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.170
I'll take over while you do!

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:35.670
That's impossible, Kei!

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:37.210
There's no other way!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:38.900
Just give me control!

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:39.880
They're coming!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:47.280
It's responding better than I thought!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:52.770
That's crazy!

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:03.360
Damn it! I can't shake them off!

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.000
I know!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.070
Gripen! Set the canard straight up!

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:09.270
Incomprehensible.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.780
If you do that...

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.210
Just do it!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.070
Set it back!

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.590
<i>I'm using the canard as an air brake.</i>

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:24.200
<i>If I keep the throttle open, 
then when the Xi passes me...</i>

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.560
<i>I can catch up to it!</i>

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:33.160
I never thought of that.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:36.690
The canard is automatically controlled 
by the fly-by-wire systems,

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:40.110
but you're an Anima, so you can 
control them freely, right?

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:41.280
Yes, but...

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.600
It's crazy!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.840
What if the airframe broke?

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:46.990
Who cares? It all worked out.

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:48.420
So now...

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.680
I-Is that...?

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:54.320
I'm ready, Kei.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:57.050
I'll shoot them all down now.

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:05.410
Gripen is heading for the combat zone.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:08.150
EGG status stabilized. Direct link: normal.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:13.140
TFS303, 306 are at 30% strength remaining!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.840
Locking on target. Fox 2!

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.490
So this is how an Anima flies?

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:29.750
I never understood it before...

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.510
But now I can understand.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.600
I'm feelin' good!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.780
What I was missing was Kei.

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:49.460
I was born to fly with Kei.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.230
Here we go.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.100
Fox 2!

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.090
Damn it!

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:23.040
Just a little more. Hang in 
there just a little more...

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:27.270
My body... My head!

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:32.340
Oh... so this is it.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.460
This is the world you see.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:40.990
Let's fly together, Kei.

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:13.530
Fox 2!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:29.800
Kei?

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:38.840
I wanted to fly... with you a little more...

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:16.090
Kei! Wake up! You'll be late!

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:18.850
You can't be late on your 
first day of school!

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:20.760
Get changed!

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:25.900
I know... I know, just give me five minutes.

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:28.330
I'll be really mad if you fall asleep again.

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:30.750
Ow...

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:36.210
<b>Soldem 1</b>

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:35.330
You're tougher than I thought.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.200
I'm surprised.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:40.720
No... I'm a mess inside and out.

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:45.860
Oh, that thing you said you saw 
when you were about to pass out.

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:53.260
Our opinion is that, ordinarily,
what you saw would be impossible.

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:56.810
The human brain isn't set 
up to deal with an NFI.

00:22:56.810 --> 00:23:00.440
It can't share the senses of 
an Anima or her Daughter.

00:23:01.220 --> 00:23:03.860
Then wh...

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:08.880
No idea. Maybe you passed out and dreamed it?

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.090
<i>I don't know what it was I saw.</i>

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:20.290
<i>But I'm sure the answer is in the sky.</i>

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:24.120
<i>On the other side of the sky,
I'll fly with her!</i>

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:30.140
Next time on <i>Girly Air Force</i>...

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:34.400
ALT 05: "Independent Mixed Test Unit."

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:39.970
<i>Independent Mixed Test Unit</i>

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:38.680
Barbie 01, cleared for take off!
